{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 120}

Verse 1
[G]The [F#dim]Ga[C]li[G]le[Em]an [G]fish[D]ers [G]toil all [Am]night, [G]and [Am]no[D]thing [G]take;
But [D]Je[Em]sus [D]comes,- [G]a won[A]drous [D]spoil [Bm]is [Em]lift[D]ed [G]from [D]the [G]lake.
